#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""aos-eca-turn - 外部 coding agent（claude／codex，eca）的一輪：把 stack 的 queue 裡的信照順序全部一起交給 CLI——交出去就收信——等它答完、回答接進 history。

10-31 改名、升成 bin 指令（使用者「aos eca turn」；C-54 R13 aos-<領域>-<功能>；前身 lib/eca/turn 格的 turn.py，叫法 aos-exec <turn 格>）：

    aos-eca-turn [--one] [--on-empty stop|idle] [--on-busy yield|answer] [--prompt FILE] <定義資料夾絕對路徑>

  旗標在位置參數前（aos_flags.parse）。定義的 loop.json 直接叫它：
    {"exec": {"argv": ["aos-eca-turn", "--on-empty", "idle", "--on-busy", "yield", {"$env": "AOS_CD"}], "timeout_ms": 900000}}
  --on-empty（10-31 取代環境變數 ECA_ON_EMPTY，不再讀它）：queue 空時 stop（沒給；退 10＝loop 收工＝射後不理）｜idle（退 0＝loop 隔 interval_ms 再來）。
  --on-busy（10-31，SessionBad 退讓的開關）：yield（沒給）＝有人佔著就這輪退讓（見下）｜answer＝照常答、不因畫面被佔而退讓
    （lock 拿不到就等、有人接在畫面上照樣貼進畫面答、busy.txt 在就等它消失再貼，期限照 cli.json 的 timeout_ms，逾時 ReplyMissing）。
  --prompt FILE（11-04，開場白檔；使用者「不該在json中指定檔案名稱，應該改成用旗標指定」，thinking 2026-10-30-eca/21）：
    相對路徑從定義資料夾算；給了但不是檔＝PromptMissing、空字串＝ArgumentsBad、跟 --one 一起給＝ArgumentsBad（工具形沒有 queue）；
    沒給＝沒有開場白（不找 prompt.txt）。例：["aos-eca-turn", "--on-empty", "stop", "--prompt", "prompt.txt", {"$env": "AOS_CD"}]。

定義資料夾＝eca 的定義（templates/eca-claude 那種）：頂層 cli.json（kind claude｜codex、flags、print_flags、timeout_ms；
  cli_session 讀的同一份；11-03 起選填 tools、tools_flags；寫了 prompt 不看，開場白走 --prompt）、選填 tools.json（aos-tools 的登記檔：cli.json 沒寫 tools
  就用它，接上 aos-mcp，工作區＝$AOS_WS、stack＝$AOS_STACK；11-03 eca-tools）。定義不被寫（P-15）；寫的都在 $AOS_STACK。

平級形（沒有 --one）——一次替它答一批（11-03 起：使用者 11-03「每次aos-eca-turn就是把所有信一起丟進去(當然，是有順序的)」「一批幾封無上限」，thinking 2026-10-30-eca/17-11-03-批次-status.md；原本一次一則）：
  ① 這一批＝queue 的 cur/ 全部（認領了、還沒交出去的：上次 --on-busy yield 退讓、或 CLI 沒起來）＋ new/ 全部（aos-post take-all），
     照處理順序（aos_ws.letter_key：有序在前照名字＝寄的順序、無序在後照名字；11-03 aos-post 改版，同 aos-post），幾封都行、沒有上限；CLI 跑的期間才寄來的信留在 new/，下一輪再答。
     history 空、queue 也空、--prompt 給的開場白檔非空＝先把它當一則 user 投進 queue（aos-post send --ordered）再認領。
  ② 讀信（aos-post see）：body 不是 {"role": "user", "content": 非空字串}＝壞信，aos-post done 丟掉、原因寫進
     $AOS_STACK/mailbox_warning.txt 一行（只留最後一封；N-16），跳過它、其他封照答（衝突 5、Q-4；11-03 前記在 trace、退 0）。
     名字不是有序的不再算壞信（11-03 aos-post 改版：有序、無序同箱，無序的排在最後、照樣答）。
     整批都是壞信＝不問 CLI、退 0。
  ③ 好信的 content 照順序用一個空行（"\n\n"）接成一段，交給 cli_session 問一次（小格＝$AOS_STACK/<kind>/）：畫面開著＝貼進畫面等 hook；
     沒開＝claude -p --resume／codex exec resume（第一次開新的）——兩條路照 10-24，跟工具形是同一段（cli_session.ask）。
  ④ 交出去就算完成（11-03，使用者「對於eca來說，他收到信後，丟給claude之類的，然後這封信就算是完成了」，thinking 2026-10-30-eca/20-11-03-交出去就收.md）：
     題目交給 CLI 的那一刻（非互動＝CLI 起來、題目寫進 stdin；畫面＝貼上按 Enter；cli_session.ask 的 handed）、等回答之前，
     好信 body 照順序各接一則 user 進 history，再 aos-post done 這批每一封（刪掉）。之後 CLI 的輸出就是結果（沒有「回信」，
     使用者 11-03「沒有回信。claude的輸出結果就是這樣」）：接成一則 {"role": "assistant", "content": 輸出} 進 history。
     CLI 中途掛掉（CliFailed、ReplyMissing、這支被殺）＝邊緣狀況：信已經收了、不自動重答，要重答由人再 say
     （使用者 11-03「中途掛掉就是邊緣狀況，不要讓邊緣狀況影響他的原本意思」；P-12 在 eca 的例外，見 P-43）。
  ⑤ queue 空（cur/、new/ 都沒信）：照 --on-empty——stop 退 10、idle 退 0（Q-9）。
  ⑥ 11-03 起不寫 $AOS_STACK/trace.jsonl（使用者「整個拿掉」，thinking 2026-11-03-trace）；要看狀態用 aos-agent ctl status。
  ⑦ 拿到 session id 就在小格建 transcripts/<kind>-<id>.jsonl symlink（cli_session.link_transcript，C-15～17）。
  ⑧ 換台開新對話（11-10 two-machines 05）：session.txt 沒有、或 cli_session 認出它不是這台的（記號檔 .session_home 的 session／home、
     claude 再加 ws 不同；記號檔有 machine 的再比機器，11-10 TS 8）＝在交出去之前改開新對話，題目前面接一段開場白＝這支組的「整理過的紀錄」（reseed；cli_session.ask 叫它）：
     來源＝這輪交出去之前的 $AOS_STACK/history.jsonl；英文說明一段＋`--- record: N messages, M shown ---`＋`[user]`／`[assistant]` 一則一段
     ＋`--- end of record ---`＋一個空行。第一則 user 一定帶、其餘從最新往回裝到上限，中間省掉的寫一行 `[... K earlier messages left out ...]`；
     單則超過 6000 bytes 留頭 4000＋尾 2000、中間寫 `[... N bytes left out ...]`（照 UTF-8 bytes 算、不切壞字）。上限＝cli.json 選填
     reseed_bytes（預設 48000；畫面那條路取 min(它, 8000)），整段含說明不超過它；0 或說明本身就超過＝只給說明、不附紀錄。history 空＝不接。
     換台這件事本身不掉信（判斷在交信之前）；人想重開＝停著、手刪小格的 session.txt（可先改 history.jsonl）。
  ⑩ history 被改過＝開新對話（11-10 晚 self-family，使用者「4.接受縮水版」；10-30 eca 09「停著時改 history 再繼續」第 2 條路）：
     CLI 的對話在 claude／codex 那邊、aos 改不到，所以 history.jsonl 被別人改了（aos-agent history、self_history、手改），下一輪就
     不續舊對話、開新的，題目前面照 ⑧ 接改過的紀錄。怎麼認：每輪 assistant 接進 history 之後，把整份的 sha256 寫進小格的 .history_sum；
     下一輪交出去之前算一次，不一樣＝cli_session.drop_session（刪 session.txt、.session_home）＋一行 warning。這一輪中間被改的
     （腦叫 self_history；交出去之後 history 跟交出去那刻不一樣）＝.history_sum 寫 edited，下一輪照樣開新的。沒有 .history_sum＝不比。
     畫面開著＝不換（對話在畫面裡），只印 warning。代價：對方的快取與 session id 換掉、紀錄只帶 user／assistant 文字（上限同 ⑧）。
  ⑨ 失敗後冷卻（11-10 two-machines 06，使用者裁「失敗後冷卻，只拿一封試」；檔＝$AOS_STACK/cooldown.json，讀寫一律走 lib/agent/cooldown.py）：
     一輪開始、認領信之前看 cooldown.state——cooling＝不認領任何信（new/、cur/、history 都不動）、退 0；due＝這輪只交最舊的一封
     （cur/ 先、照 letter_key；new/ 用 aos-post take 一次認領一封；壞信照舊丟、記 mailbox_warning，再往下找一封好信）；none＝照舊整批。
     交出去之後的失敗（CliFailed、ReplyMissing；看 handed 有沒有被叫過）＝cooldown.fail（dropped＝這批的封數）再照舊報錯退 1；
     交出去之前的錯不寫冷卻、SessionBad 退讓不算失敗；寫冷卻檔失敗只多一行 warning。成功（assistant 接進 history 之後）＝cooldown.clear。
  ⑪ hook（11-10 晚 self-family/hook，圖紙 § 6 eca 縮水版；lib/agent/hooks.py，定義＝DEF_DIR、stack＝$AOS_STACK）：好信讀出來、交出去之前每封
     queue_before（可改 content；攔下＝aos-post done 收掉、不交、不進 history、mailbox_warning.txt 寫 `letter SIG dropped by hook HOOK`；整批都被丟＝同整批壞信）；
     交出去之前 tool_added（這輪生效的登記檔比上次多的名字；有這種 hook 才多叫一次 aos-tools ls --json）；handed 裡信接進 history、收掉之後每封 queue_after；
     交出去之後的 CliFailed／ReplyMissing＝記冷卻之前 brain_failed（name＝代號、reason＝這支那行的原因）。tool_before／tool_after 在 aos-mcp（cli_session 帶 --hooks DEF_DIR）。
     hook 停下＝HookFailed／HooksBad 退 1：交出去之前＝信留 cur/、history 不動；queue_after 停下＝回答照樣接進 history 才報；brain_failed 停下＝冷卻不記。
  --on-busy yield 時 SessionBad（拿不到格的 lock：另一次呼叫或 attach 正在開畫面；有人接在 tmux 畫面上；busy.txt 在＝畫面正在跑一輪）
    ＝還沒交出去：這次退 0 不動、整批信留在 cur/、history 不動，下一次再試（interval_ms）；--on-busy answer 不退讓（見上）。
  人在畫面上自己打的話不進 history（沒經 queue；eca 方向題 2）。
  11-04 起不寫 $AOS_STACK/eca.json（名片沒人讀了：aos-eca 刪了，aos-agent 從 daemon 表的 def 欄找定義；thinking 2026-11-04 aos-agent 05）。
--one（工具形，P-41 工具契約）：stdin {"prompt"} → stdout 回答，對話在 $AOS_STACK 這格本身（cli_session.call_main，需有效的 $AOS_WS）；
  lib 的 claude／codex 走 lib/agent/agent_tool.py 的 ask_cli，與這裡共用 cli_session.ask。
  --on-busy 照認（yield 時 SessionBad 照錯退 1）；跟 --on-empty 一起給＝ArgumentsBad（工具形沒有 queue）。
  工具形沒有 history：舊對話不在這台＝stderr 一行 warning、開新對話不附紀錄（05）；不做冷卻（06）。
  錯照 lib 契約 stderr 與 stdout 各一行「<定義資料夾名>: 代號 原因」、退 1。
PATH 上要有 aos-post（平級形）。
錯（平級形與 argv）：stderr 一行「aos-eca-turn: error: 代號 原因」、退 1（P-20 停下等人；11-05 stdio-unify R1，usage 在原因後面）。
  aos-post 的 stderr 原樣透出（不攔、不拿它的第一行當原因；R10），這支只多寫自己那一行（PostFailed「aos-post X exited N」）。交出去之前的錯（CliMissing、ToolsMissing、
  畫面等 busy.txt 逾時的 ReplyMissing…）＝整批信留在 cur/（或還在 new/）、history 不動，修好重跑整批照問；交出去之後的錯＝信已收、user 已接、
  沒有 assistant，不重答（④）。
  代號：ArgumentsBad、FlagUnknown、AgentBad、StackMissing、PromptMissing（11-04：--prompt 給的開場白檔不在）、HistoryBad、PostFailed、WriteFailed，
  HookFailed、HooksBad、ToolsBad（⑪ tool_added 叫 aos-tools ls 失敗），
  加 cli_session 的 CfgMissing、CfgBad、ToolsMissing（11-03 eca-tools：cli.json 的 tools 指的登記檔不在）、CliMissing（含 aos-mcp 不在 PATH 上）、
  CliFailed、ReplyMissing（yield 時的 SessionBad 不算錯，見上）。
`--help`＝印 HELP（英文）到 stdout、退 0（R3）；Ctrl-C＝退 130、不吐 traceback（R12）。"""
import hashlib, json, os, subprocess, sys

HERE = os.path.dirname(os.path.realpath(__file__))
sys.dont_write_bytecode = True
from pathlib import Path

_import_paths = [HERE]
for _parent in Path(__file__).resolve().parents:
    for _layer, _module in (("py", "aos_flags.py"), ("lib", "agent/__init__.py")):
        _root = _parent / _layer
        if (_root / _module).is_file() and str(_root) not in _import_paths:
            _import_paths.append(str(_root))
sys.path[:0] = _import_paths
try:
    import aos_flags, aos_ws  # noqa: E402
    if os.path.isfile(os.path.join(HERE, "cli_session.py")):
        import cli_session  # noqa: E402
    else:
        import agent.cli_session as cli_session  # noqa: E402
    if os.path.isfile(os.path.join(HERE, "cooldown.py")):
        import cooldown  # noqa: E402
    else:
        import agent.cooldown as cooldown  # noqa: E402
    if os.path.isfile(os.path.join(HERE, "hooks.py")):
        import hooks  # noqa: E402
    else:
        import agent.hooks as hooks  # noqa: E402
finally:
    for _path in _import_paths:
        sys.path.remove(_path)

NAME = "aos-eca-turn"
NOT_FOUND = 10
USAGE = "aos-eca-turn [--one] [--on-empty stop|idle] [--on-busy yield|answer] [--prompt FILE] DEF_DIR"
aos_flags.HELP = """aos-eca-turn - one turn of an external coding agent (claude / codex, an "eca"): hand every letter in the stack's queue,
in order, to the CLI as one prompt (handing it over = the letters are done), wait for the answer, append it to history.

    aos-eca-turn [--one] [--on-empty stop|idle] [--on-busy yield|answer] [--prompt FILE] DEF_DIR

DEF_DIR: the eca definition folder (absolute; cli.json at its top, optional tools.json). It is never written; everything goes to $AOS_STACK.
Loop form (no --one): the batch = all of queue/cur/ plus all of queue/new/; bad letters are dropped and noted in
  $AOS_STACK/mailbox_warning.txt; good contents are joined with a blank line and asked once (a pasted screen if one is open,
  otherwise claude -p --resume / codex exec resume). The user messages go into history.jsonl when the prompt is handed over, the
  answer goes in as one assistant message.
  --on-empty stop (default): empty queue = exit 10 | idle: exit 0.
  --on-busy yield (default): the session is busy (lock taken, someone attached, busy.txt) = leave the batch in cur/, exit 0 |
    answer: wait and answer anyway.
  --prompt FILE: opening message (relative to DEF_DIR) queued when history and queue are both empty.
  New conversation: when there is no session.txt, or the earlier conversation is not on this machine (its .session_home names
    another session, account folder, machine or - for claude - workspace), a new one is started before the letters are handed over, and
    a record built from history.jsonl goes in front of the prompt: a short note, the first user message, then the newest messages
    that fit. Its size limit is cli.json's optional reseed_bytes (default 48000; at most 8000 when pasting into a screen; 0 = the
    note only). Delete session.txt by hand to restart the conversation on purpose.
  History changed: when history.jsonl differs from how the last turn left it (aos-agent history, self_history, a hand edit),
    the next turn starts a new conversation the same way, carrying the changed record (not while the screen is open).
  Cooldown: a failure after the prompt was handed over (CliFailed, ReplyMissing) is recorded in $AOS_STACK/cooldown.json; while
    cooling, no letter is taken (exit 0); when the cooldown is over, only the oldest letter is tried; a success removes the file.
  Hooks (hooks.json declared in DEF_DIR's interfaces.json, the stack copy on top): queue_before before a good letter is handed over
    (may change content or drop it; a dropped letter is done and noted in mailbox_warning.txt), tool_added before handing over,
    queue_after after the letters went into history, brain_failed on CliFailed / ReplyMissing after handing over. tool_before /
    tool_after run in aos-mcp. A failing hook = HookFailed (letters not yet handed over stay in cur/).
--one (tool form): stdin {"prompt"} -> stdout the answer; the conversation lives in $AOS_STACK itself. --on-empty / --prompt not allowed.
  If the earlier conversation is not on this machine, a warning is printed and a new one is started without a record. No cooldown.
Needs aos-post on PATH (loop form) and AOS_STACK.
Errors: one stderr line `aos-eca-turn: error: CODE reason`, exit 1 (tool form: the line also goes to stdout). aos-post's own stderr
  is passed through as it is. Codes: ArgumentsBad, FlagUnknown, AgentBad, StackMissing, PromptMissing, HistoryBad, PostFailed,
  WriteFailed, HookFailed, HooksBad, ToolsBad, CfgMissing, CfgBad, ToolsMissing, CliMissing, CliFailed, ReplyMissing."""


class Fail(Exception):
    """自己這層或 cli_session 的錯：code＝代號。"""

    def __init__(self, code, reason):
        super().__init__(str(reason).replace("\n", " "))
        self.code = code


def die(code, reason):
    aos_flags.die(NAME, code, reason)


def names(box, stage):
    """某一格裡的信件名稱（. 開頭的不算，N-05），照處理順序（aos_ws.letter_key）排。"""
    try:
        return sorted((n for n in os.listdir(os.path.join(box, stage)) if not n.startswith(".")), key=aos_ws.letter_key)
    except (FileNotFoundError, NotADirectoryError):
        return []


def write_atomic(path, text):
    """N-05：先寫同資料夾 . 開頭的暫存檔再改名。"""
    tmp = os.path.join(os.path.dirname(path), "." + os.path.basename(path) + ".tmp")
    try:
        with open(tmp, "w", encoding="utf-8") as f:
            f.write(text)
        os.replace(tmp, path)
    except OSError as e:
        raise Fail("WriteFailed", "cannot write %s: %s" % (path, e))


def post(args, stdin_text=""):
    """叫共用的 aos-post 介面，把錯誤換成這層的 Fail。"""
    try:
        return aos_ws.run_post(args, stdin_text)
    except aos_ws.Error as e:
        raise Fail(e.code, e)


def must_post(args, stdin_text="", ok=(0,)):
    code, out = post(args, stdin_text)
    if code not in ok:
        raise Fail("PostFailed", "aos-post %s exited %d" % (args[0], code))
    return code, out


# ---- history（$AOS_STACK/history.jsonl，一行一則 OpenAI message，只附加；P-41）----

def history_rows(stack):
    rows = []
    try:
        with open(os.path.join(stack, "history.jsonl"), encoding="utf-8") as f:
            for i, line in enumerate(f, 1):
                if not line.strip():
                    continue
                try:
                    m = json.loads(line)
                except ValueError:
                    m = None
                if not isinstance(m, dict):
                    raise Fail("HistoryBad", "history.jsonl line %d is not a JSON object" % i)
                rows.append(m)
    except FileNotFoundError:
        pass
    except OSError as e:
        raise Fail("HistoryBad", "cannot read history.jsonl: %s" % e)
    return rows


SUM = ".history_sum"                                           # ⑩ 小格裡：上一輪結束時 history 的 sha256（或 edited）


def history_sum(stack):
    try:
        with open(os.path.join(stack, "history.jsonl"), "rb") as f:
            return hashlib.sha256(f.read()).hexdigest()
    except FileNotFoundError:
        return hashlib.sha256(b"").hexdigest()
    except OSError as e:
        raise Fail("HistoryBad", "cannot read history.jsonl: %s" % e)


def history_changed(stack, cell):
    """⑩ 交出去之前：history 跟上一輪結束時不一樣＝丟掉 CLI 的舊對話（下一步 ask 照 ⑧ 開新的、帶改過的紀錄）。"""
    seen = cell.read(SUM)
    if not seen or seen == history_sum(stack):
        return
    if cell.alive():
        aos_flags.warn(NAME, "history.jsonl was changed, but the screen is open, so the conversation there keeps its old record")
        return
    cli_session.drop_session(cell)
    aos_flags.warn(NAME, "history.jsonl was changed since the last turn; starting a new %s conversation that carries the changed record" % cell_kind(cell))


def cell_kind(cell):
    return os.path.basename(cell.path)


def note_sum(stack, cell, edited):
    try:
        with open(cell.file(SUM), "w", encoding="utf-8") as f:
            f.write(("edited" if edited else history_sum(stack)) + "\n")
    except (OSError, Fail) as e:
        aos_flags.warn(NAME, "cannot write %s: %s" % (cell.file(SUM), e))


def append_history(stack, msg):
    try:
        with open(os.path.join(stack, "history.jsonl"), "a", encoding="utf-8") as f:   # 一次寫一整行
            f.write(json.dumps(msg, ensure_ascii=False) + "\n")
    except OSError as e:
        raise Fail("WriteFailed", "cannot append to history.jsonl: %s" % e)


# ---- mailbox_warning.txt ----

def warn(stack, sig, why):
    """N-16 壞信記 mailbox_warning：$AOS_STACK/mailbox_warning.txt 一行、只留最後一封（11-03 前記在 trace）。"""
    write_atomic(os.path.join(stack, "mailbox_warning.txt"), "letter %s rejected: %s\n" % (sig, why.replace("\n", " ")))


# ---- hook（lib/agent/hooks.py；圖紙 thinking/2026-11/10/self-family/hook § 6 eca 縮水版）----

def fire(event, data, template, stack):
    """跑 hook；hook 停下＝這支的錯（HookFailed／HooksBad）。"""
    try:
        return hooks.fire(event, data, template, stack, warn=lambda line: aos_flags.warn(NAME, line))
    except (hooks.HookFailed, hooks.HooksBad) as e:
        raise Fail(type(e).__name__, e)


def queue_before(stack, box, sig, body, template):
    """好信交出去之前跑 queue_before：回（可能改過 content 的）body；被攔下＝aos-post done 收掉、mailbox_warning 一行、回 None。"""
    r = fire("queue_before", {"letter": sig, "content": body["content"]}, template, stack)
    if r["blocked"]:
        post(["done", box, sig])
        write_atomic(os.path.join(stack, "mailbox_warning.txt"), "letter %s dropped by hook %s\n" % (sig, r["hook"]))
        return None
    return dict(body, content=r["data"]["content"])


def tool_added(cfg, template, stack):
    """tool_added：這隻實際生效的登記檔（cfg["registry"]）的名單比上次多出來的，一個名字一次；沒這種 hook＝不叫 aos-tools、刪 seen 檔。"""
    try:
        on = hooks.has("tool_added", template, stack)
    except hooks.HooksBad as e:
        raise Fail("HooksBad", e)
    listed = []
    if on and cfg.get("registry"):
        try:
            r = subprocess.run(["aos-tools", "--file", cfg["registry"], "ls", "--json"], stdin=subprocess.DEVNULL,
                               stdout=subprocess.PIPE, text=True)          # stderr 不吞：aos-tools 自己說哪裡壞
        except OSError as e:
            raise Fail("ToolsBad", "aos-tools cannot start: %s" % e)
        if r.returncode != 0:
            raise Fail("ToolsBad", "aos-tools ls exited %d" % r.returncode)
        try:
            listed = [(t["name"], os.path.abspath(t["path"]) if t.get("path") else None) for t in json.loads(r.stdout)]
        except (ValueError, TypeError, KeyError) as e:
            raise Fail("ToolsBad", "aos-tools ls --json printed something else: %s" % e)
    try:
        added = hooks.tools_added(stack, listed, on)
    except OSError as e:
        raise Fail("WriteFailed", "cannot write %s: %s" % (os.path.join(stack, hooks.SEEN), e))
    for name, where in added:
        fire("tool_added", {"name": name, "path": where}, template, stack)


# ---- 一批 ----

def letter_body(box, sig):
    """好信回 (body, None)；壞信回 (None, 原因)。"""
    code, out = post(["see", box, sig])
    if code != 0:
        return None, "aos-post see exited %d" % code
    try:
        body = json.loads(out).get("body")
    except (ValueError, AttributeError):
        return None, "aos-post see did not print a JSON object"
    if not (isinstance(body, dict) and body.get("role") == "user" and isinstance(body.get("content"), str)
            and body["content"].strip()):
        return None, "body must be {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": non-empty string}"
    return body, None


def opening(stack, box, path):
    """history 空、queue 也空、有開場白檔＝把開場白投進 queue（射後不理那種的第一則）。回 True＝投了。
    開場白檔＝--prompt 給的（main 已轉成絕對路徑）；沒給（None）＝沒有開場白，不找 prompt.txt（11-04 翻案）。"""
    if not path:
        return False
    try:
        with open(path, encoding="utf-8") as f:
            text = f.read()
    except FileNotFoundError:                                       # main 驗過之後才被刪掉；給了就要有
        raise Fail("PromptMissing", "prompt file not found: %s" % path)
    except OSError as e:
        raise Fail("AgentBad", "cannot read %s: %s" % (path, e))
    text = text[:-1] if text.endswith("\n") else text           # 結尾一個換行不算
    if not text.strip() or history_rows(stack):
        return False
    must_post(["send", "--ordered", box], json.dumps({"role": "user", "content": text}, ensure_ascii=False))
    return True


SEP = "\n\n"                                   # 一批好幾封時，各封 content 照順序用一個空行接起來（11-03 代定）


def pick_one(stack, box, prompt, template):
    """冷卻到了（06）：只拿最舊的一封好信——cur/ 先、照 letter_key；cur/ 沒有好信才從 new/ 用 aos-post take 一次認領一封。
    壞信照舊丟、記 mailbox_warning，再往下找。回 ([sig], [body], 丟了幾封)；一封好信都沒有＝([], [], 丟了幾封)。"""
    if not names(box, "new") and not names(box, "cur"):
        opening(stack, box, prompt)
    dropped = 0
    while True:
        for sig in names(box, "cur"):
            body, why = letter_body(box, sig)
            if body is not None:
                body = queue_before(stack, box, sig, body, template)
                if body is not None:
                    return [sig], [body], dropped
                dropped += 1
                continue
            post(["done", box, sig])
            warn(stack, sig, why)
            dropped += 1
        code, _ = must_post(["take", box], ok=(0, NOT_FOUND))    # new/ 最前面一封 → cur/
        if code == NOT_FOUND:
            return [], [], dropped


def take_all(stack, box, prompt):
    """new/ 裡的信全部認領到 cur/（aos-post take-all；沒信退 NOT_FOUND＝剛好被撤回，不算錯）；一批幾封沒有上限（11-03）。
    history 空、queue 也空、給了開場白檔（--prompt）＝先投開場白再認領。"""
    if not names(box, "new") and not names(box, "cur") and not opening(stack, box, prompt):
        return
    if names(box, "new"):
        must_post(["take-all", box], ok=(0, NOT_FOUND))            # new/ → cur/


def one_turn(template, stack, ws, empty_code, on_busy, prompt):
    box = os.path.join(stack, "queue")
    if not all(os.path.isdir(os.path.join(box, s)) for s in ("tmp", "new", "cur")):
        must_post(["init", box])                                   # 先建好，aos-agent say／listen 認得
    cfg = cli_session.load_cfg(template)
    cell = cli_session.Cell(os.path.join(stack, cfg["kind"]))
    cool, _ = cooldown.state(stack)                                # ⑨ 認領信之前看冷卻（06）
    if cool == "cooling":
        return 0                                                    # 一封都不認領：new/、cur/、history 都不動
    if cool == "due":
        good, bodies, dropped = pick_one(stack, box, prompt, template)       # 冷卻到了：只試最舊的一封
        if not good:
            return 0 if dropped else empty_code
    else:
        take_all(stack, box, prompt)                               # 這輪要答的＝cur/ 全部（上次沒交出去的＋剛認領的）
        batch = names(box, "cur")
        if not batch:
            return empty_code
        bodies, good = [], []
        for sig in batch:                                           # ② 照順序讀信
            body, why = letter_body(box, sig)
            if body is None:                                        # 壞信一律丟（N-16、決定 27 不通知寄信人）
                post(["done", box, sig])
                warn(stack, sig, why)
                continue
            body = queue_before(stack, box, sig, body, template)   # hook：可改 content、可丟掉這封（整批都丟＝同整批壞信）
            if body is None:
                continue
            bodies.append(body)
            good.append(sig)
        if not good:
            return 0
    tool_added(cfg, template, stack)                                # hook：登記檔多了誰（交出去之前；hook 停下＝信留 cur/）
    history_changed(stack, cell)                                    # ⑩ history 被改過＝開新對話
    late, given, mid, after = [], [], [], []                        # 交出去那一刻收信時出的錯：CLI 已經在跑，等它答完再報；after＝queue_after hook 停下

    def handed():                                                   # ④ 交出去就算完成（11-03）：user 接進 history、收信
        given.append(True)
        try:
            for body in bodies:
                append_history(stack, body)
            for sig in good:
                must_post(["done", box, sig])
            mid.append(history_sum(stack))                          # ⑩ 交出去那刻的 history
        except Fail as e:
            late.append(e)
            return
        try:
            for sig, body in zip(good, bodies):                     # hook：接進 history、收掉之後，每封一次
                fire("queue_after", {"letter": sig, "content": body["content"]}, template, stack)
        except Fail as e:
            after.append(e)                                         # 回答照樣接進 history，最後才報（不掉回答）
    try:
        text = cli_session.ask(cfg, cell, template, ws, stack, SEP.join(b["content"] for b in bodies), on_busy,
                               handed, lambda limit: reseed(stack, ws, limit))   # 一批一次（11-03）；跟工具形同一段；stack 給 aos-mcp（11-03 eca-tools）
    except Fail as e:
        if e.code == "SessionBad":                                  # 只有 --on-busy yield 會丟，一定在交出去之前
            return 0                                                # 整批留 cur/，下一次再試
        if given and e.code in ("CliFailed", "ReplyMissing"):      # ⑨ 交出去之後的失敗：記冷卻（這批掉了）
            fire("brain_failed", {"name": e.code, "reason": str(e)}, template, stack)   # hook 停下＝HookFailed，冷卻不記（同 agent-fsm wait）
            try:
                cooldown.fail(stack, e.code, e, dropped=len(good))
            except OSError as w:
                aos_flags.warn(NAME, "cannot write %s: %s" % (cooldown.path(stack), w))
        raise
    if late:
        raise late[0]
    edited = bool(mid) and history_sum(stack) != mid[0]             # ⑩ 這一輪中間被改了（腦叫了 self_history）
    append_history(stack, {"role": "assistant", "content": text[:-1] if text.endswith("\n") else text})
    note_sum(stack, cell, edited)
    try:
        cooldown.clear(stack)                                       # ⑨ 成功一次＝歸零
    except OSError as w:
        aos_flags.warn(NAME, "cannot remove %s: %s" % (cooldown.path(stack), w))
    if after:
        raise after[0]
    return 0


# ---- 開場白（⑧ 換台開新對話；two-machines 05）----

ONE_MAX, ONE_HEAD, ONE_TAIL = 6000, 4000, 2000              # 單則超過 ONE_MAX bytes：留頭 ONE_HEAD＋尾 ONE_TAIL

NOTE = """[aos: this conversation continues in a new session (it moved to another machine or folder, or was restarted).
The earlier session is not available here. Below is the record aos kept of it: what you were asked and your
final answers (tool calls and their output are not included; long or old messages are shortened or left out).
The complete record is the JSON-lines file %s. The new message follows the record.]
"""
NOTE_ONLY = """[aos: this conversation continues in a new session (it moved to another machine or folder, or was restarted).
The earlier session is not available here. aos keeps a record of it (what you were asked and your final answers)
in the JSON-lines file %s; it is not attached here. The new message follows.]
"""


def nbytes(text):
    return len(text.encode("utf-8"))


def shorten(text):
    """單則超過 ONE_MAX bytes：留頭 ONE_HEAD＋尾 ONE_TAIL bytes、中間一行說省了多少；照 UTF-8 切、不切壞字。"""
    raw = text.encode("utf-8")
    if len(raw) <= ONE_MAX:
        return text
    head = raw[:ONE_HEAD].decode("utf-8", "ignore")              # 切在字中間的那幾個 byte 丟掉
    tail = raw[-ONE_TAIL:].decode("utf-8", "ignore")
    return "%s\n[... %d bytes left out ...]\n%s" % (head, len(raw) - nbytes(head) - nbytes(tail), tail)


def entry(row):
    """history 一則 → 一段 `[role] content\n`；content 不是字串就印成 JSON。"""
    content = row.get("content")
    if not isinstance(content, str):
        content = json.dumps(content, ensure_ascii=False)
    return "[%s] %s\n" % (row.get("role") if isinstance(row.get("role"), str) else "unknown", shorten(content))


def reseed(stack, ws, limit):
    """開新對話時接在題目前面的開場白（cli_session.ask 的 reseed；在交出去之前叫，history 還沒接這輪的 user）。
    history 空＝""。結尾一個空行。整段 ≤ limit bytes；limit 0、或說明加第一則 user 就超過＝只給說明（NOTE_ONLY）。"""
    rows = history_rows(stack)
    if not rows:
        return ""
    where = os.path.relpath(os.path.join(stack, "history.jsonl"), ws)
    only = NOTE_ONLY % where + "\n"
    if limit <= 0:
        return only
    n = len(rows)
    parts = [entry(r) for r in rows]
    sizes = [nbytes(p) for p in parts]
    first = next((i for i, r in enumerate(rows) if r.get("role") == "user"), None)
    gap = nbytes("[... %d earlier messages left out ...]\n" % n)  # 省略行最長也就這樣（K ≤ n）
    fixed = nbytes(NOTE % where + "\n--- record: %d messages, %d shown ---\n--- end of record ---\n\n" % (n, n))

    def cost(chosen):
        """chosen（排好的 index）組出來最多幾 bytes：固定段＋各則＋每個空隙一行省略。"""
        holes = sum(1 for a, b in zip([-1] + chosen, chosen + [n]) if b - a > 1)
        return fixed + sum(sizes[i] for i in chosen) + holes * gap

    chosen = [first] if first is not None else []
    if cost(chosen) > limit:
        return only
    for i in range(n - 1, -1, -1):                                  # 其餘從最新往回裝，裝不下就停
        if i == first:
            continue
        trial = sorted(chosen + [i])
        if cost(trial) > limit:
            break
        chosen = trial
    out, prev = [NOTE % where, "\n", "--- record: %d messages, %d shown ---\n" % (n, len(chosen))], -1
    for i in chosen + [n]:
        if i - prev > 1:
            out.append("[... %d earlier messages left out ...]\n" % (i - prev - 1))
        if i < n:
            out.append(parts[i])
        prev = i
    out.append("--- end of record ---\n\n")
    return "".join(out)


def _cli_die(code, reason):                    # cli_session 出錯時本來 exit；平級形改成丟例外，這支自己說一行
    raise Fail(code, reason)


def main():
    try:
        opts, args = aos_flags.parse(sys.argv[1:], {"--on-empty": "on_empty", "--on-busy": "on_busy", "--prompt": "prompt"},
                                     {"--one": "one"})
    except aos_flags.Error as e:
        die(e.code, "%s (usage: %s)" % (e, USAGE))
    if len(args) != 1:
        die("ArgumentsBad", "%s (usage: %s)" % ("missing DEF_DIR" if not args else "only one DEF_DIR allowed, extra: %s" % args[1], USAGE))
    empty, busy = opts.get("on_empty", "stop"), opts.get("on_busy", "yield")
    if empty not in ("stop", "idle"):
        die("ArgumentsBad", "--on-empty must be stop or idle, got %r" % empty)
    if busy not in ("yield", "answer"):
        die("ArgumentsBad", "--on-busy must be yield or answer, got %r" % busy)
    if opts.get("one") and "on_empty" in opts:
        die("ArgumentsBad", "--one (tool form) has no queue; --on-empty not allowed")
    if opts.get("one") and "prompt" in opts:
        die("ArgumentsBad", "--one (tool form) has no queue; --prompt not allowed")
    if opts.get("prompt") == "":
        die("ArgumentsBad", "--prompt needs the path of a prompt file")
    template = args[0]
    if not os.path.isabs(template) or not os.path.isdir(template):
        die("AgentBad", "definition dir must be an existing absolute path, got %r" % template)
    template = os.path.normpath(template)
    prompt = None
    if "prompt" in opts:                                           # 相對路徑從定義資料夾算（11-04）
        prompt = os.path.normpath(os.path.join(template, opts["prompt"]))
        if not os.path.isfile(prompt):
            die("PromptMissing", "--prompt file not found: %s" % prompt)
    if opts.get("one"):
        cli_session.call_main(template, busy)                      # --one 專用入口；lib 的 ask_cli 與它共用 cli_session.ask
        return
    stack = os.environ.get("AOS_STACK")
    if not stack:
        die("StackMissing", "AOS_STACK is not set")
    stack = os.path.abspath(stack)
    ws = os.path.abspath(os.environ.get("AOS_WS") or ".")
    cli_session.die = _cli_die
    try:
        code = one_turn(template, stack, ws, NOT_FOUND if empty == "stop" else 0, busy, prompt)
    except Fail as e:
        die(e.code, e)
    sys.exit(code)


aos_flags.run(main)
